      "value": "@{5bbbf6aa17bab877dd8bc723|full_name}: depends how scared of crashing people are. Most of the \"safety settings\" are more or less pointless. Most of my friends and I have everything on the safety disabled, and I just run the normal particle limiter like I've been doing for months without much issue.",
