      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ba5d139dabace1d8df9df6f|full_name}: It's not a matter of being scared, it's being tired of idiot children blue screening people at will. I'm already seeing them trying and failing to crash people because of the safety settings. \n\nI was getting crashed so much at one point that I stopped playing the game just to rant in the vrc discord, because I literally couldn't play. And I'm not even on a crash list. It's just random douchebags joining privates somehow just to crash people because they could.\n\nWith the new client I've fallen asleep in crowded publics twice in the past week and not been bothered. That's a huge difference.\n\nI'm actually seeing an entirely different problem here. If people are so elitist that they're bashing people based on rank, why would any of you want be friends with them? They're just outing themselves as shallow people that aren't worth talking to anyway.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
