      "value": "@{5bb3f9263fef0d0c9262b019|full_name}: You can still do that with the settings or by selecting people. It gives you a whole menu of options to limit what renders for you or block a person, or just their avatar, or mute them. It makes a big performance difference for me having lowest ranks blocked or limited. \n\nThere are a lot of public avatars that are horrible unoptimized cancer. You don't even notice it by looking, but if you find a public avatar that someone has shared and you throw it in blender to have a look, you realize, \"Oh, this has 30 freakin materials on it.\"",
