      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I wanna point out something useful with this. Social games, especially ones that garnish a lot of attention such as what is brought in with streamers does attract varies kinds of bad crowds. If you find someone is actually abusing people of lower ranks or generalizing them, you should question your friendship with them. It creates a good opportunity to expose those kind of people as normaly they would seem nice, until they have a position of power to abuse. Block the elitist, and if your a visitor whose being harassed by elitist, then block em and be happy that you'll never be in that manipulative hell. Find friends who are more interested in conversation, if your saying you can't start a conversation cuz of elitist blocking you, then start looking around, because theres plenty of other people to talk to.",
