      "value": "I (a known user) don't see the bullying based on rank happen alot. I've only seen it happen once. It seems to be a rare occurrence. I for one enjoy meeting people in vrchat, and a rank isn't going to stop me from talking to people.\n\nhowever i do agree that the colored nameplates disappearing wouldn't hurt most of the vrchat community (just the few that really feel superior to a person because they're higher ranked). instead having to click on a user to see their rank would be a nice alternative. I feel it would stop  the whole blocking and muting on sight scenario the OP described.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
