      "value": "@{5ba46ce5b4abea117d3cb0f9|full_name}: \"however i do agree that the colored nameplates disappearing wouldn't hurt most of the vrchat community (just the few that really feel superior to a person because they're higher ranked).\"\n\nI feel that the colored name plate help me to see which groups to block avatars on when I'm really laggy. \"Oh, there's a lot of purple users? Let's block their avatars to help cut down on lag...\" Very useful in my honest opinion.\n\n\"instead having to click on a user to see their rank would be a nice alternative.\" Me: *point* *click* *click* *click* *click* *click* *click* WHY IS IT NOT WORKING?! *click* *click* *start pointing at random people* *click* *click* *click* *click*  *close menu* *open menu* *repeat until it finally works* *click the previous button until I find the one person that I was looking for*\n\nNow that I think about it, I wonder if there's a bug report already on that...",
