      "value": "@{5bbbf6aa17bab877dd8bc723|full_name}: this is too easy for you to say. Before *and* after the update, I have rarely been crashed despite hanging out in public Pug instances all the time. I feel like you're greatly exaggerating the issue. People's dumb behavior shouldn't be blamed on the crashers alone.\n\nBluescreens don't just happen that easily either, there has to be something wrong with the hardware or software for a full-on BSOD to happen. The worst thing an application should be able to do is crash.",
